# Myanmar — tech, social & AI domains for selective proxy
# Copy: cp domains-myanmar.txt.example domains.txt
#
# Two reasons these need a proxy from Myanmar:
#   A) Junta censorship (since 2021 coup) — OONI-verified blocks
#   B) Service geo-restriction — provider does not support Myanmar (e.g. Google AI Studio)
#
# Sources: OONI/internetinmyanmar.com (2024–2026), Freedom House, Google AI regions list
# Blocking varies by ISP/day — this list is a practical superset, not guaranteed complete.
#
# NOTE: Meta/Google use many CDN subdomains (scontent.*.fbcdn.net etc.).
#       selective mode resolves these base domains only; add more if images/assets fail.
#       For Facebook-heavy use, browser SOCKS + SwitchyOmega is often more reliable.

# =============================================================================
# SOCIAL — blocked by Myanmar junta (OONI ≥60% anomaly)
# =============================================================================

# Facebook / Meta
facebook.com
fb.com
fbcdn.net
facebook.net
fbsbx.com
messenger.com

# Instagram
instagram.com
cdninstagram.com

# WhatsApp
whatsapp.com
web.whatsapp.com

# X / Twitter
twitter.com
x.com
t.co
twimg.com

# Signal (blocked Jul 2024)
signal.org

# Telegram (restricted / monitored; include if needed)
telegram.org
t.me

# TikTok (surveillance target; may be blocked on some ISPs)
tiktok.com
tiktokcdn.com
tiktokv.com
byteoversea.com

# =============================================================================
# REFERENCE — Wikipedia blocked 2022
# =============================================================================
wikipedia.org
wikimedia.org

